[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13260.71, "timestamp": "03:41:00", "text": "金色の鍵を手に入れるには、たくさんのボスや金色のロボットと戦わなければなりません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13261.269, "timestamp": "03:41:01", "text": "ああ、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 13263.714, "timestamp": "03:41:03", "author": "@Ghewar_Ji_ka_No-1FAN", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/CqrtcQvHFvr33XJk7uI96qZ5HyIAEb1ifU1jdPzM7vetPMlUZ4oYhF9BjVOj5xYYbkMi18Zfvg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/E8MfY5u7JPSXkNAP95GAmAEUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/E8MfY5u7JPSXkNAP95GAmAE"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13265.91, "timestamp": "03:41:05", "text": "それから、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13268.55, "timestamp": "03:41:08", "text": "サブルーチンと呼ばれるものも収集する必要があります。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13270.87, "timestamp": "03:41:10", "text": "サブルーチン。 まるで小さなコインのようだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13275.67, "timestamp": "03:41:15", "text": "7個必要なんですが、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13278.15, "timestamp": "03:41:18", "text": "それらは超レア、超"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13279.75, "timestamp": "03:41:19", "text": "超レアなんです。   わかった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13280.229, "timestamp": "03:41:20", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13282.71, "timestamp": "03:41:22", "text": "そして、それらを7つ集めれば、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13285.19, "timestamp": "03:41:25", "text": "最終ボスマップに挑戦できます。 つまり、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13288.469, "timestamp": "03:41:28", "text": "クライアーカイブマップ内のボス部屋のことです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13289.99, "timestamp": "03:41:29", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13291.91, "timestamp": "03:41:31", "text": "パズルを解くことと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13296.95, "timestamp": "03:41:36", "text": "チームワークが非常に重要です。 だから、先ほども言ったように、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13298.87, "timestamp": "03:41:38", "text": "このゲームではチームメイトがいることは本当に本当に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13302.15, "timestamp": "03:41:42", "text": "有益です。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13305.429, "timestamp": "03:41:45", "text": "ええ、それは分かります。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13307.59, "timestamp": "03:41:47", "text": "わあ、私が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13311.349, "timestamp": "03:41:51", "text": "使っている女性キャラクターの肌、気に入ったわ。"}]